		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,<br />C&#039;est sont mes bases:<br />postgres@postgres=# \l</p><p>&#160; &#160;Name&#160; &#160; |&#160; Owner&#160; &#160;| Encoding<br />-----------+----------+----------<br /> cave&#160; &#160; &#160; | postgres | UTF8<br /> cave3&#160; &#160; &#160;| postgres | UTF8<br /> cave_old&#160; | postgres | UTF8<br /> cave_test | postgres | UTF8<br /> postgres&#160; | postgres | UTF8<br /> template0 | postgres | UTF8<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |<br /> template1 | postgres | UTF8<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;|&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; |<br />(7 rows)<br />Voici les répertoires:<br />Dans C:\Program Files\PostgreSQL\9.6\data\base<br />25/12/2017&#160; 18:17&#160; &#160; &lt;REP&gt;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 12400<br />27/04/2018&#160; 16:14&#160; &#160; &lt;REP&gt;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 12401<br />26/04/2018&#160; 10:41&#160; &#160; &lt;REP&gt;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 16394<br />26/04/2018&#160; 10:41&#160; &#160; &lt;REP&gt;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 16680<br />26/04/2018&#160; 10:41&#160; &#160; &lt;REP&gt;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 16709<br />26/04/2018&#160; 10:41&#160; &#160; &lt;REP&gt;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 16730</p><p>Comment lier un répertoire à une base?<br />D&#039;avance merci.</p>]]></content>
